      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The direct alkylheteroarylation of alkenes with cyclic and acyclic ethers via distal heteroaryl ipso-migration has been accomplished through the design of a photoredox-mediated C-H functionalization pathway. The use of inexpensive ethers as radical precursors combined with a straightforward method makes this a practical approach."},
